### REST client routes for the contacts API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Home page
GET http://localhost:3001
Accept: text/html

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3001/
Accept: application/json

### Get one contact by id
GET http://localhost:3001/6a0dfe505b413bcf50ba2e3f
Accept: application/json

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3001/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "email": "iriebibyupathway.edu",
    "userName": "Bi",
    "name": "Oluwafemi",
    "ipAddress": "192.168.1.50"
  }

### Update a contact by id
PUT http://localhost:3001/6a0c20bb9d57c87818cf1337 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "email": "emmabyupathway.edu",
    "userName": "Bijudicael",
    "name": "Emma Aho",
    "ipAddress": "192.168.1.38"
  }

### Delete a contact by id
DELETE http://localhost:3001/6a0c5b1f912782e50361d37b

### Render HTML contacts list
GET http://localhost:3001/
Accept: text/html
